    70	<h1 data-layer="fact">The judge required notice before a Kennedy Center demolition</h1>
    71	<p class="story-dek" data-layer="fact">The September 17 order denied an emergency hearing but required written notice more than 30 days before the defendants implement a change to the project plans previously presented to the court, including demolition of the main building. It did not decide whether demolition would be lawful.</p>
