   325	<p class="chart-source">The first entry comes from the court's account of the Center announcing that renovation work had begun. The same record defines the REACH as the Center's expansion campus.<sup class="src-ref">
   326	<a href="#src-9" data-record-href="/records/preservation-opinion-45-2026-05-29/" data-passage="work has begun!" aria-label="Source 9: read the evidence">9</a>
   327	</sup>
   328	<sup class="src-ref">
   329	<a href="#src-10" data-record-href="/records/beatty-opinion-50-2026-05-29/" data-passage="expansion campus, known as the REACH" aria-label="Source 10: read the evidence">10</a>
