   429	</p>
   430	<p class="oc-sources">
   431	<sup class="src-ref">
   432	<a href="#src-20" data-record-href="/records/pbs-ap-kennedy-center-2026-09-17/" data-passage="provide 30 days' notice before making any major physical changes" aria-label="Source 20: read the evidence" data-passages="All of those proposals were shot down Tuesday by Cooper">20</a>
   433	</sup>
   434	<sup class="src-ref">
   435	<a href="#src-11" data-record-href="/records/beatty-opinion-77-2026-09-15/" data-passage="However, the Court denies as unripe" aria-label="Source 11: read the evidence">11</a>
   436	</sup>
