_2_Trump_KennedyCenter_vert_,500,800,1200,1800,2500,3200,4500,.mp4.csmil/playlist.m3u8"}},"dmp":{"shield":{"9x16":"https://watch.auth.api.espn.com/video/auth/media/136534870/asset?context=news_abcn&aspectRatio=9x16"}}},"transcript":{"webVtt":"https://abcnews.entertainment.meta.distro.dtci.technology/v1/public/captions/id/136534870?brand=abcn","rawWebVtt":"WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:00.470\nAnd Karen,\n\n2\n00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.540\nPresident Trump threatening to either get his name on the Kennedy Center\n\n3\n00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:04.670\nor shut it down.\n\n4\n00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.070\nYou asked him why that's so important to him.\n\n5\n00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.000\nWhat did he tell you?\n\n6\n00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:08.270\nYes,\n\n7\n00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.590\nI asked him this yesterday.\n\n8\n00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:13.390\nWhy is it so important for his name to be added to the Kennedy Center,\n\n9\n00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.830\nwhich of course is a living memorial to the late President John F.\n\n10\n00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:17.390\nKennedy.\n\n11\n00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:20.190\nThe president told me yesterday it is a mess and\n\n12\n00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:23.150\nthat he is the only one that can change that.\n\n13\n00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:23.600\nDiane,\n\n14\n00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.110\nhere's what he had to say to me yesterday.\n\n15\n00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:28.800\nI'm the one capable of fixing it\n\n16\n00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:29.990\nand then have to\n\n17\n00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:32.470\nsubsidize it for years to come because\n\n18\n00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.560\nyou will lose with the Kennedy Center.\n\n19\n00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.820\nThey were losing hundreds of millions of dollars and sometimes\n\n20\n00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:38.880\nhundreds of millions.\n\n21\n00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:40.690\nThis is before I got involved.\n\n22\n00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.810\nSo for the Trump administration,\n\n23\n00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:43.570\nfor me\n\n24\n00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:44.390\nto\n\n25\n00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:47.320\nget involved and to take that on long term.\n\n26\n00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.710\nAnd to carry it or to raise money to carry it,\n\n27\n00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:53.180\nI think that the Trump administration\n\n28\n00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:54.990\nshould certainly have recognition\n\n29\n00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.090\nbecause frankly,\n\n30\n00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:57.420\nif we don't do that,\n\n31\n00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:58.760\nit's going to close,\n\n32\n00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:00.470\nit will end up being ripped down\n\n33\n00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:01.270\nand Diane,\n\n34\n00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.310\nI pushed him on that.\n\n35\n00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:02.670\nI said,\n\n36\n00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:05.019\nare you saying if your name is not\n\n37\n00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:08.590\nadded that you We're going to tear down the building and Diane,\n\n38\n00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.050\nhe again repeated that point about recognition.\n\n39\n00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:11.520\nHe said,\n\n40\n00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:12.010\nquote,\n\n41\n00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:14.190\nI think the Trump administration\n\n42\n00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:15.490\nshould be recognized.\n\n43\n00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:17.350\nThat answer yesterday to me\n\n44\n00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:21.890\nhas already been added to a federal filing today as part of this effort\n\n45\n00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.640\nto not have a demolition carried out there."},"alertTag":"","sectionRoot":"US","adFlag":false,"noAds":true,"isAmbient":false,"sponsored":false,"hideDate":false,"hideReportTypo":false,"ads":{"tags":["NoAds"]},"classification":"Other"},"featuredImage":null,"dateline":"","seo":{},"LivePromotion":{},"PersonalizedRecommend":{}},"autoUpdate":{"enabled":true,"topics":["general-elections-2026-balance-of-power","general-elections-2026-national-map-electoral","general-elections-2026-race-feed-all"]}},"upw":{"configuration":{},"generalData":{"e