        <p data-layer="narrative">Later on September 18, thousands joined the Hands Around the Kennedy Center protest, and some formed a human chain around the building. The organizer invited artists, patrons, staff members, union members and volunteers.<Cite s="ap-kennedy-center-protest-2026-09-18" passage="Thousands of people joined outside" /><Cite s="ap-kennedy-center-protest-2026-09-18" passage="formed a human chain around the center" /><Cite s="action-network-hands-around-kennedy-center-2026-09-18" passage="Worked at the Center as a staff member, union member, or volunteer" /></p>
