00:00:17.857 --> 00:00:19.359
years has lost tens of millions

00:00:19.359 --> 00:00:24.364
of dollars, even hundreds of

00:00:24.364 --> 00:00:25.465
millions of dollars.

00:00:25.599 --> 00:00:38.378
And many other places like that,

00:00:38.378 --> 00:00:42.382
have to subsidize it for years

00:00:42.515 --> 00:00:42.949
to come.

00:00:43.383 --> 00:00:45.819
They will lose the Kennedy

00:00:45.952 --> 00:00:48.021
center -- sometimes hundreds of

00:00:48.388 --> 00:00:49.990
millions, before I got involved.

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:54.394
So for the trump administration,

00:00:54.461 --> 00:00:56.396
for me, to take that long term

00:00:56.463 --> 00:00:58.531
and carry it or to raise money

00:00:58.665 --> 00:01:01.401
to carry it, I think the trump

00:01:01.401 --> 00:01:01.901
administration should certainly

00:01:02.035 --> 00:01:03.403
have recognition.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:09.409
Frankly, if we don't do that

00:01:09.542 --> 00:01:18.418
it's going to --

00:01:18.418 --> 00:01:18.618
[inaudible]

00:01:18.752 --> 00:01:22.422
It's been very badly maintained

00:01:22.422 --> 00:01:23.056
for 25 years.

00:01:23.423 --> 00:01:25.659
It's going to take a lot of

00:01:25.792 --> 00:01:28.428
subsidies into the future, and

00:01:28.428 --> 00:01:29.829
for us, for the administration

00:01:29.963 --> 00:01:32.532
to do that, I think the trump

00:01:32.666 --> 00:01:34.434
administration should be


