ss report carried by PBS NewsHour</a> · Associated Press via PBS NewsHour, 2026-09-17 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the broad major-physical-changes formulation checked against the order</span></li><li id="src-21" value="21"><a href="/records/upi-kennedy-center-2026-09-17/">UPI on the notice order</a> · UPI, 2026-09-17 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the reproduced operative sentence of the minute order</span></li><li id="src-22" value="22"><a href="/records/usa-today-kennedy-center-comments-2026-09-16/">USA Today on demolition remarks</a> · USA Today, 2026-09-16 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the September 16 statements put before the court</span></li><li id="src-23" value="23"><a href="/records/usa-today-kennedy-center-order-2026-09-17/">USA Today on the notice order</a> · USA Today, 2026-09-17 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the immediate-demolition characterization checked against the order</span></li><li id="src-26" value="26"><a href="/records/cbs-kennedy-center-2026-09-17/">CBS News on the demolition dispute</a> · CBS News, 2026-09-17 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the Kennedy Center spokesperson’s no-demolition statement</span></li><li id="src-33" value="33"><a href="/records/ap-kennedy-center-protest-2026-09-18/">Associated Press report on the Kennedy Center protest</a> · Associated Press, 2026-09-18 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the protest size and human chain</span></li><li id="src-35" value="35"><a href="/records/ap-trump-kennedy-center-2026-09-18/">Associated Press report on Trump’s Kennedy Center remarks</a> · Associated Press, 2026-09-18 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; Trump’s response to a direct demolition question</span></li></ol><p class="sources-line"><a href="/methodology">How we check</a> <span data-layer="proof"> &middot; where this page says <em>computed</em>, the arithmetic was done from the saved data series; where it says <em>record</em> or <em>checked</em>, the words trace to a saved document</span>.</p></section><details class="record-ledger" data-record-ledger data-layer="fact" data-state-derived><summary>Figures in the source documents <span class="series-count">2</span></summary><article class="ledger-row" data-state-slot="slot-106afc94-7212-41ea-8fad-b160b224df14"><h3>Number in the more-than-30-days notice requirement</h3><strong class="ledger-value" data-state-figure="story-figure:ac13c39c1564750fcd0e38770fb3616169a32b95e0a8e37499ddbb7dcca276d1" data-state-figure-role="current" data-figure-value="30" data-figure-unit="days">30 days</strong><a class="ledger-source" href="/records/upi-kennedy-center-2026-09-17/" data-passage="more than 30 days before the implementation" aria-label="Read the source for Number in the more-than-30-days notice requirement">UPI <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details class="ledger-source-passage"><summary>Recorded passage</summary><blockquote data-source-copy>more than 30 days before the implementation</blockquote></details></article><article class="ledger-row" data-state-slot="slot-b105d119-6be2-42e2-b25c-8b9bc654574d"><h3>Votes in favor of the August closure resolution</h3><strong class="ledger-value" data-state-figure="story-figure:6d43ab5c88e2f31c776ae08be3143e7deb8c01414b0e7dd8808975f91760b897" data-state-figure-role="current" data-figure-value="23" data-figure-unit="votes in favor">23 votes in favor</strong><a class="ledger-source" href="/records/board-minutes-68-3-2026-08-13/" data-passage="23 in favor, 3 opposed" aria-label="Read the source for Votes in favor of the August closure resolution">Kennedy Center Board of Trustees <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details class="ledger-source-passage"><summary>Recorded passage</summary><blockquote data-source-copy>23 in favor, 3 opposed</blockquote></details></article></details><section class="revision-timeline" data-layer="fact" data-revision-confirmations="0" data-revision-changes="0"></section><section data-layer="proof"><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href="/records/board-minutes-68-3-2026-08-13/" data-source-copy>Kennedy Center Board of Trustees</a> · August 13, 2026 · <span data-source-copy>Kennedy Center board meeting minutes</span></li><li><a href="/records/upi-kennedy-center-2026-09-17/" data-source-copy>UPI</a> · September 17, 2026 · <span data-source-copy>UPI on the notice order</span></li></ul></section></main></div><footer class="colophon"><p>Published records carry their review status on the page. Work that has not been published is clearly labeled. Corrections and withdrawals are permanent, dated, and public.</p><p><a href="/">The Catch</a> <a href="/methodology">How we check</a> <a href="/records/">Source library</a></p></footer></div><div id="evidence-preview" class="evidence-preview" popover="manual" role="tooltip"><p class="preview-title"></p><p class="preview-copy"></p><span>Click to read in context</span></div><dialog id="evidence-reader" class="evidence-reader" aria-labelledby="evidence-title"><header class="evidence-toolbar"><span>Source reader</span><div><button type="button" data-expand-evidence aria-label="Expand source reader" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 9V4h5m6 0h5v5M4 15v5h5m6 0h5v-5"></path></svg></button><button type="button" data-close-evidence aria-label="Close source reader"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="evidence-identity"><p class="evidence-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><h2 id="evidence-title">Source</h2><p class="evidence-byline"></p><p class="evidence-purpose"></p><div class="evidence-view-controls" hidden><button type="button" data-context-view aria-pressed="true">Passage in context</button><button type="button" data-full-view aria-pressed="false">Full saved text</button></div></div><div class="evidence-scroll"><div class="evidence-text" tabindex="0"></div></div><footer class="evidence-footer"><button type="button" data-close-evidence>Back to reading</button><a data-source-page>Source details</a><a data-saved-page>Saved document ↗</a></footer></dialog><script type="module" src="/_astro/EvidenceReader.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.C3JJvVMO.js"></script></body></html><script type="module" src="/_astro/BaseLayout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.DSlozcIj.js"></script>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro:70:        <p data-layer="narrative">The order also required the administration to update Cooper by September 23 on the status of the temporary closure and emergency repairs.<Cite s="abc-kennedy-center-2026-09-17" passage="update him on the status of the" /><Cite s="abc-kennedy-center-2026-09-17" passage="emergency repairs" /> Beatty's counsel said Cooper “ordered discovery into the Board’s actions related to a potential demolition.”<Cite s="beatty-counsel-reaction-2026-09-17" passage="ordered discovery into the Board’s actions related to a potential demolition" /> UPI's reproduced order text contains the notice command but no discovery provision.<Cite s="upi-kennedy-center-2026-09-17" passage="the Court hereby ORDERS Defendants" /></p>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro:99:        <p data-layer="narrative">The May opinion records Floca's estimate that between {affectedPeople.closureEstimateLow} and {affectedPeople.closureEstimateHigh} of roughly {affectedPeople.employeeEstimateTotal} employees would be affected by the closure. It also says several performance contracts would be affected, the Center had laid off at least {affectedPeople.layoffTranches} groups of staff including programming personnel, and {affectedPeople.remainingProgrammingStaff} programming staff remained.<Cite s="beatty-opinion-50-2026-05-29" passage="75 to 175 of roughly 300 employees at the Center would be affected" /><Cite s="beatty-opinion-50-2026-05-29" passage="The closure will affect several existing performance contracts" /><Cite s="beatty-opinion-50-2026-05-29" passage="laid off at least two tranches of staff members" /><Cite s="beatty-opinion-50-2026-05-29" passage="just ten members of the programming staff remain" /></p>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro:104:        <p data-layer="narrative">Floca identified two immediate safety grounds: an engineering assessment of the roof-terrace canopy and the September 4 failure of a five-by-four-foot piece of ceiling plaster after water damage. The same declaration reported severe corrosion in 46 of 278 panels and said one-third of the panels required immediate replacement.<Cite s="floca-declaration-86-1-2026-09-17" passage="a roof terrace canopy assessment" /><Cite s="floca-declaration-86-1-2026-09-17" passage="failure of a five-by-four-foot piece of one-inch-thick ceiling plaster on September 4" /><Cite s="floca-declaration-86-1-2026-09-17" passage="severe corrosion in 46 panels" /><Cite s="floca-declaration-86-1-2026-09-17" passage="One-third of all panels require immediate replacement" /> Cooper denied the requested hearing. Neither UPI's reproduced order text nor counsel's release reports a resolution of the parties' factual dispute.<Cite s="upi-kennedy-center-2026-09-17" passage="Beatty's request for a hearing was denied" /><Cite s="beatty-counsel-reaction-2026-09-17" passage="Judge Cooper additionally ordered discovery" /></p>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro:128:        <p data-layer="narrative">The existing scheduling order had already opened expedited discovery on Beatty's closure claim. It set September 23 deadlines for written discovery requests and deposition notices, September 30 for written responses, October 7 for completed depositions and October 9 for the close of discovery.<Cite s="scheduling-order-82-2026-09-16" passage="Requests for Written and Document Discovery" /><Cite s="scheduling-order-82-2026-09-16" passage="All Discovery Closed" /></p>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro:129:        <p data-layer="narrative">The September 17 order added the update and advance-notice requirements. The September 16 scheduling order separately set deadlines for a motion to vacate the preliminary injunction and for discovery on the closure claim.<Cite s="beatty-counsel-reaction-2026-09-17" passage="required the Board to update the Court by September 23" /><Cite s="upi-kennedy-center-2026-09-17" passage="more than 30 days before the implementation" /><Cite s="scheduling-order-82-2026-09-16" passage="Motion to Vacate the Preliminary" /></p>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro:132:        <p data-layer="narrative">The defense filings agree that the board voted again to close the main building, but they quote the timing differently. The statement of facts says it would close to patrons immediately; the supporting memorandum says closure would follow dissolution of the preliminary injunction.<Cite s="defendants-statement-facts-89-2-2026-09-18" passage="shall be closed to patrons forthwith" /><Cite s="defendants-consolidated-memorandum-88-1-2026-09-18" passage="forthwith upon the dissolution of the preliminary injunction" /></p>

